{"card_ids": [], "category": "architecture", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-19T13:02:00+08:00", "excerpt": "知识工具由 Skill 在 skills/cs/scripts/cs_knowledge.py 提供，外部项目只保存自身的数据、配置和 Wiki，并通过 --root 指向项目根目录调用共享工具。", "fingerprint": "ee57213dfaa0853b5f67397970b53f74de7ea853d4d2afed7d868b1969368ed0", "id": "K-20260819-130200-01-ee57213d", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/architecture/k-20260819-130200-01-ee57213d-外部项目复用-skill-的共享知识工具.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/scripts/bootstrap.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "shared_runtime_path"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/60_governance.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "runtime_alignment"}, {"path": "skills/cs/scripts/cs_knowledge.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "main"}], "sha256": "fb676f014382d344ed80cba6a5a52322ff4caa25b7b02f85b9ed56e653afca94", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": [], "symbols": [], "tags": ["共享工具", "运行时兼容"], "title": "外部项目复用 Skill 的共享知识工具", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T13:02:00+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "architecture", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "excerpt": "升级程序只对发行清单拥有的文件执行原地更新或退役，不创建自动备份目录。旧知识页继续保留在原路径，迁移清单记录路径、SHA-256 摘要和字节数，随后由知识整理流程逐页对照代码、测试和当前 Wiki 更新结论。", "fingerprint": "706c2a679ab4da58b9bd15fedd7787a5e2b85c7cfa997b7f53b4dfe0800fb25b", "id": "K-20260819-144342-01-706c2a67", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/architecture/k-20260819-144342-01-706c2a67-升级采用原地结构更新与逐页知识核对.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/scripts/bootstrap.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "install"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/00_core.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "validate_knowledge_migration_source"}], "sha256": "bb328652ef6debf0c44953149d8c1fa94710c9b36cbcf70bc9ea191e6034e95b", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": ["K-20260729-103956-01-1a0dad7b"], "symbols": [], "tags": ["upgrade", "migration", "no-backup"], "title": "升级采用原地结构更新与逐页知识核对", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "architecture", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-28T12:11:06+08:00", "excerpt": "task-note 是逻辑任务的追踪记录，不是 Git 变更清单。提交漂移检查只要求至少一个代表性 self scope、路径或变更符号与语义改动直接重合；Git 已确认的任务删除或重命名路径是有效任务范围，但 current 卡片引用这些路径时仍需审核。已经写入 task-note 的 knowledge_use 永久保留当时实际读取的卡片 revision，卡片后续升级不会迫使旧证据改写；新的影响必须用当前 revision 追加。", "fingerprint": "2efd800746af0dc4cf12274a656c85cd7b4f9d61e56330b51d252e0a48edcd9b", "id": "K-20260828-121106-01-2efd8007", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/architecture/k-20260828-121106-01-2efd8007-任务记录使用代表性范围并保留知识使用历史版本.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/30_learning.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "merge_task_knowledge_use"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/50_drift.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "learning_reference_check"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/50_drift.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "task_note_drift"}], "sha256": "400259dcdea487d61c5c3dec518c313831f64439e9baf5261833e648f29d289a", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": [], "symbols": [], "tags": ["task-note", "drift", "knowledge-use", "revision", "provenance"], "title": "任务记录使用代表性范围并保留知识使用历史版本", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:11:06+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "compatibility", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-07-29T10:39:56+08:00", "excerpt": "一个 legacy Markdown 页只有在 current 实现/测试真相和 current Wiki 覆盖均已核对、该页的 learn 与 doctor 成功、源 SHA-256 未变化且同哈希备份存在时，才能从原 legacy 目录移除；证据不足的 pending 页必须保留并使 upgrade 保持未完成。", "fingerprint": "039346a2359def9754ad250bebae0b782d36d17fa25936de2de4635538eda23e", "id": "K-20260729-103956-02-039346a2", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/compatibility/k-20260729-103956-02-039346a2-旧知识页仅在审计和可恢复性校验后移除.md", "paths": ["skills/cs/SKILL.md", "docs/migration.md", "skills/cs/assets/project/.codestable/manifest.json"], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [], "sha256": "e8f608bfd234fb6628ef0ced2d24f958ee77b438221ce44186eb8d8eef15b214", "status": "superseded", "superseded_by": ["K-20260819-144342-02-d505d15b"], "supersedes": [], "symbols": ["install", "legacy_page_inventory"], "tags": ["compatibility", "history", "backup", "provenance"], "title": "旧知识页仅在审计和可恢复性校验后移除", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "compatibility", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-07T15:13:02+08:00", "excerpt": "一次 CodeStable upgrade 维护一条 knowledge-migration task-note，并在完整逐页账本中保存 legacy 哈希、备份、结论和证据；pending 页面保留且使升级保持 partial。", "fingerprint": "2608ee7f7851e9eef4f95cbe817387dbf755d063eed38dff32e6535443f33d11", "id": "K-20260807-151302-02-2608ee7f", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/compatibility/k-20260807-151302-02-2608ee7f-upgrade-逐页证据聚合到单一任务记录.md", "paths": ["skills/cs/SKILL.md", "docs/migration.md", "skills/cs/assets/project/.codestable/tools/cs_knowledge.py"], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [], "sha256": "82741f0180ff0259d9c1db15b074b6b17e5d1df550c190e6b39b0af4fb08ca39", "status": "superseded", "superseded_by": ["K-20260819-144342-02-d505d15b"], "supersedes": [], "symbols": ["validate_knowledge_migration_source", "normalize_learning_payload"], "tags": ["upgrade", "legacy", "audit", "compatibility"], "title": "upgrade 逐页证据聚合到单一任务记录", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "compatibility", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-19T13:02:00+08:00", "excerpt": "已有项目中的 .codestable/tools/cs_knowledge.py 由发行清单声明为退役文件；普通检查不改动它，只有显式升级才会先把它备份到 .codestable/backups 后再移除。", "fingerprint": "765d2222f4683f4c1b95b94ccd0e684dd1d727741c171d2d4558240921efb48a", "id": "K-20260819-130200-02-765d2222", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/compatibility/k-20260819-130200-02-765d2222-旧项目内工具仅在显式升级时安全退役.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/assets/project/.codestable/manifest.json", "repository": "self", "symbol": "retired_files"}, {"path": "skills/cs/scripts/bootstrap.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "install"}], "sha256": "cd01752ec573f4e25f2bbe3a4a19b3e199da5275e8bd8d5747c9cd8a6298723e", "status": "superseded", "superseded_by": ["K-20260819-144342-02-d505d15b"], "supersedes": [], "symbols": [], "tags": ["显式升级", "可恢复备份"], "title": "旧项目内工具仅在显式升级时安全退役", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "compatibility", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "excerpt": "结构升级保留项目编写的 Wiki、模型、知识和工作数据，并把旧知识留在原位供逐项核对。既有 .codestable/backups 目录属于历史数据，升级会忽略并保持其内容不变，但不会再创建新的自动备份。无效配置会使升级明确失败并保留原文件。", "fingerprint": "d505d15bf1d45e5b938ee2f9f8668b719f401401685c254687da839c8d30af6b", "id": "K-20260819-144342-02-d505d15b", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/compatibility/k-20260819-144342-02-d505d15b-升级保留项目知识并停止自动备份.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/scripts/bootstrap.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "install"}, {"path": "tests/test_bootstrap.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "BootstrapTests"}], "sha256": "100dfa0769e19c7abe3d3668e4b124f57e84ddf9f7916c895fd2ab8ae32470ad", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": ["K-20260729-103956-02-039346a2", "K-20260807-151302-02-2608ee7f", "K-20260819-130200-02-765d2222"], "symbols": [], "tags": ["upgrade", "preservation", "configuration"], "title": "升级保留项目知识并停止自动备份", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:43:42+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "decisions", "confidence": "accepted", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-07-29T11:04:04+08:00", "excerpt": "cs 不使用 Wiki、测试和源码之间的单一事实优先级：accepted 的需求、约束和决策表达目标状态，verified 行为事实表达已验证状态；冲突时必须判断实现偏离、行为回归、scope 变化或知识过期。", "fingerprint": "f9a191d9fb5ad40e865fb995b410c950d0394311fdbfb772e0c4dad64dca6cb0", "id": "K-20260729-110404-01-9cb2de99", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/decisions/k-20260729-110404-01-9cb2de99-知识冲突按目标状态与当前行为分类判定.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 2, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/SKILL.md", "repository": "self", "symbol": ""}, {"path": "docs/architecture.md", "repository": "self", "symbol": ""}, {"path": "docs/knowledge-format.md", "repository": "self", "symbol": ""}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/40_retrieval.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "inferred_categories"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/40_retrieval.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "score_document_details"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/40_retrieval.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "selected_brief_payload"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/40_retrieval.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "render_brief_markdown"}], "sha256": "9864e01ea647848156b8043305b6f842e871f2c787b4980c1fe122f96bdd2492", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": [], "symbols": [], "tags": ["knowledge-conflict", "authority", "verification"], "title": "知识冲突按目标状态与当前行为分类判定", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T14:50:05+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "interfaces", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-28T12:11:06+08:00", "excerpt": "template --task-id <T-...> 从当前 task-note 生成可编辑的完整更新快照，预填任务 ID、当前 revision、正文、范围、来源和历史 knowledge_use；归档任务会拒绝并指向 canonical 记录。learn --compact 保留计划令牌、应用候选、需要处理的引用、未验证引用和各类计数，只省略完整 verified 引用列表；不带该参数时继续返回完整 JSON。", "fingerprint": "15986c2d442c78c869230795ae862108f61c62b5de3edf5d1401896351a21e01", "id": "K-20260828-121106-02-15986c2d", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/interfaces/k-20260828-121106-02-15986c2d-任务更新模板和紧凑学习输出保留完整控制信息.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/70_cli.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "task_update_template"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/70_cli.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "compact_learn_result"}, {"path": "skills/cs/SKILL.md", "repository": "self", "symbol": "template --task-id"}], "sha256": "2a6a721fbfcfddb74e8ecc7e575a7360604e740cd74200ab177c121f8f858d37", "status": "superseded", "superseded_by": ["K-20260828-162416-01-fde24cad"], "supersedes": [], "symbols": [], "tags": ["cli", "template", "compact-output", "plan-token", "task-update"], "title": "任务更新模板和紧凑学习输出保留完整控制信息", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T16:24:16+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
{"card_ids": [], "category": "interfaces", "confidence": "verified", "consolidated_from": [], "consolidated_into": null, "created_at": "2026-08-28T16:24:16+08:00", "excerpt": "CodeStable 不按任务规模分级，所有任务统一执行 brief、知识处置、learn dry-run、计划令牌写入和完成检查。template 默认只生成九个语义任务字段且不预建知识卡片；确有未来可复用结论时，通过 --card-category 显式增加分类脚手架，知识卡片可以继承任务的适用范围、主题与标签。learn 默认返回紧凑结果，完整的已验证引用明细仅在 --full 下输出；紧凑结果始终保留 plan_token、候选、未验证引用、可操作问题和各类计数。任务模板中的占位符不能通过 dry-run，知识卡片的证据、未来复用场景和适用范围等质量门槛保持不变。", "fingerprint": "fde24cad7541cc18a98d437a9c08b98b885b8a9e6c4a44b92898ed5bfcefe60c", "id": "K-20260828-162416-01-fde24cad", "knowledge_use_card_ids": [], "path": ".codestable/wiki/interfaces/k-20260828-162416-01-fde24cad-学习模板和默认紧凑输出在统一质量门槛下减少机械负担.md", "paths": [], "pinned": false, "revision": 1, "scopes": [{"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/70_cli.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "template_payload"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/70_cli.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "compact_learn_result"}, {"path": "skills/cs/runtime_src/10_capture.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "normalize_task"}, {"path": ".codestable/wiki/learning.schema.json", "repository": "self", "symbol": ""}, {"path": "tests/test_governance_acceptance.py", "repository": "self", "symbol": "test_default_compact_output_stays_bounded_with_many_verified_references"}], "sha256": "8b24068d2970ce231f6d3365b603375d3eeb77f4b616e05a1d351e7ae62df6de", "status": "current", "superseded_by": [], "supersedes": ["K-20260828-121106-02-15986c2d"], "symbols": [], "tags": [], "title": "学习模板和默认紧凑输出在统一质量门槛下减少机械负担", "topics": [], "type": "knowledge-card", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T16:24:16+08:00", "visibility": "active"}
